== Trivia ==
* Bandage Girl is a secondary character in [[wikipedia:Super Meat Boy|''Super Meat Boy'']], a game by [[Edmund McMillen]], the creator of ''The Binding of Isaac''.
* Ball of Bandages' item description, "Gotta Lick 'em All!", could be a reference to the "Gotta Catch 'em All!" advertising slogan used in [[wikipedia:Pokémon|Pokémon]] media.

